meta {
  name: DETAIL ARTICLE FOR MOBILE
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/public/postsdetail/1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
}

docs {
  # **GET POST DETAIL (by id, public, used by mobile)**

  Menampilkan detail artikel berdasarkan **id**. Endpoint ini publik dan dipakai oleh aplikasi mobile.

  Response menyertakan kolom baru bila post berkategori social:
  - `source_url` — URL asli (TikTok / YouTube / Instagram)
  - `embed_provider` — `tiktok` | `youtube` | `instagram`
  - `embed` — object: `{ provider, original_url, embed_url, embed_html, thumbnail_url, title, author_name }`

  **`metadata` (sejak 2026-05-27):** JSON object opsional untuk extras per-kategori (mis. tanaman = `nama_latin`, `hari_panen_min/max`, `musim_tanam`, `kondisi_tumbuh`, `hama_umum`). Null untuk post yang belum diisi. Lihat docs di **LIST ARTICLE BY CATEGORY** untuk shape lengkap.
}

example {
  name: Tanaman detail with metadata

  request: {
    url: {{baseUrl}}/public/postsdetail/14
    method: GET
    mode: none
    headers: {
      Accept: application/json
    }
  }

  response: {
    headers: {
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
    }

    status: {
      code: 200
      text: OK
    }

    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "success": true,
          "message": "Detail Data Post",
          "data": {
            "id": 14,
            "category_id": 6,
            "user_id": 1,
            "title": "Cabai Rawit",
            "slug": "cabai-rawit",
            "image": "https://webapi.myindah-app.com/storage/posts/cabai-rawit.jpg",
            "content": "Sayuran rempah dengan permintaan tinggi sepanjang tahun.",
            "source_url": null,
            "embed_provider": null,
            "metadata": {
              "nama_latin": "Capsicum frutescens",
              "kategori_tanaman": "sayuran",
              "musim_tanam": "sepanjang_tahun",
              "hari_panen_min": 75,
              "hari_panen_max": 90,
              "tingkat_kesulitan": "sedang",
              "kebutuhan_sinar": "penuh",
              "kondisi_tumbuh": { "ph_min": 5.5, "ph_max": 6.8, "suhu_min": 18, "suhu_max": 30 },
              "hama_umum": ["thrips", "kutu daun"]
            },
            "embed": null,
            "category": { "id": 6, "name": "Tanaman" }
          }
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}
